<<
/Title (Low-code development provides an accessible and efficient approach to application development, and it is creating a growing range of career opportunities. Visual tools, reusable components and automation allow applications to be delivered faster and allow both professional developers and business users to contribute.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 256 0 R
/Next 392 0 R
>>
endobj
327 0 obj
<<
/Title (The future of low-code development will be strongly influenced by AI, automation, APIs, cloud technologies and collaboration between low-code and pro-code approaches. Developer roles are expected to evolve rather than disappear. A strong future-ready developer should therefore combine low-code platform knowledge with programming fundamentals, databases, APIs, AI tools and business understanding.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 256 0 R
/Prev 392 0 R
>>
