/Title (Figure 1 shows how these roles form a staircase. The first step is the Foundation \(basic programming, database concepts, UI/UX fundamentals, and workflow and automation\). The next steps are the Low-Code Developer \(application development, forms and reports, and business workflows\), the Specialized Developer \(automation, integration or business applications\) and the Advanced Developer / Consultant \(including Solution Developer and Platform Specialist roles\). The top steps are the Solution Architect and the Technical Lead / Enterprise Architect. The strip at the bottom of the figure lists the core skills that support every step.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 319 0 R
/Prev 429 0 R
